NOTE ON THE BUNDLED COMPLIANCE CORPUS

The legal material in src/sowsprint/rag/corpus_data.py is an ADAPTATION of subject
matter from the Atticus Project CUAD dataset and the Pile of Law, rewritten for
demonstration purposes. It is not a verbatim reproduction of those datasets, it is
not a substitute for the originals, and it does not constitute legal advice.
Consult qualified counsel before relying on any generated Statement of Work.
